---
import Dev from '../layouts/Dev.astro';
import '../styles/artwork-gallery.css';
---
<Dev title="Logos">
  <h1>Logos</h1>
  <p>Canonical brand artwork, grouped by layout and foreground-on-background colorway. PNG sizes are sorted numerically; SVG stays vector.</p>
  <div class="gallery-filters"><button id="catalog-refresh" type="button">Refresh sources</button></div>
  <p id="catalog-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Reading the brand manifest...</p>
  <div id="logo-groups"></div>
  <details><summary>Brand generator</summary><p>The generator remains the source of truth. From the repository root, <code>bun run assets:brand</code> regenerates approved layouts; <code>bun run assets:check</code> checks runtime assets. This workbench only reads existing files and never runs either command.</p><p>Transparent previews use a neutral display surface; downloads retain their original alpha channel. Stale source hashes are disclosed on each export.</p></details>
  <noscript>This local catalog needs JavaScript and the site dev server.</noscript>
</Dev>
<script>
  import { mountLogos } from '../../scripts/catalog-browser.mjs';
  mountLogos();
</script>
